# Crystal store (the Battery): adds light storage to its grid ("Battery capacity" tweak). Its charge lives on
# the structure - destroying it loses the stored light. A 4x4x4 m box (2x2 cells). Spawned origin 2.0 above
# ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a stone dais (the root), four bronze corner
# posts, and one large DIAMOND that floats between them (gems.obj): the light bank of the base, made to show
# from far. The child pieces are render-only.
Prefab gameBattery
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node CubeQuarter
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.5 0.48 0.44
		Position 0 -1.525 0
		Scale 1.9
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 2 2 2
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 2
		AlwaysShowResources true
